  m_text: "Follow the red string to guide the character to their soulmate. But be
    careful! As you move around, the \u201CPower of Love\u201D - the visibility of
    the string - will decrease and the string may disappear. If that happens, you
    can make it visible again at the Love Recharge Points on the map. Good luck! "
