  m_text: According to Far Eastern legends, when people are born, an invisible red
    string ties them together. This string represents their soulmates. Over time,
    it may stretch or tangle, but it can never break. No matter what happens, those
    two people are destined to meet someday. This is the power of the red string
    of fate.
